<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall in latest auction.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka T-bill yields fall in latest auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average yield rate of three, six and 12-month Sri Lankan treasury bills eased at Wednesday's auction which was heavily over subscribed, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>		  Bids received   Bids accepted     Avg yield</p>
<p>    3 months     3,769	     1,250	  18.07 (18.17)</p>
<p>    6 months	 632		 240	  17.87 (18.02)</p>
<p>    12 months    5,834	     4,000	  17.86 (17.93)</p>
<p>Note - Bids in million rupees, yields in percent (previous week's yields in brackets).</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
